# Added here: Protecting the Herd (314); a Loch Modan loop before Ironforge, where the walk to the
# tunnel already ends: In Defense of the King's Lands (224), The Trogg Threat (267), Stout to Kadrell
# (414), Rat Catching (416), Thelsamar Blood Sausages (418), Mountaineer Stormpike's Task (1339),
# Filthy Paws (307), Stormpike's Order (1338), Honor Students (6387, 6391, 6388) for every class, and
# on the tram Deeprun Rat Roundup (6661) and Me Brother, Nipsy (6662); Humble Beginnings (399) from
# Baros Alexston in Stormwind (02-westfall hands it in). They replace the grind to
# level 11.41 at the snow leopards.

