# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Old Icebeard

step Tundra MacGrann
  tip Tundra MacGrann camps in Chill Breeze Valley, south of the road back east from Brewnall to Kharanos. His meats are in the locker in Old Icebeard's cave, east of his camp. Old Icebeard is an elite yeti: wait out of sight until he wanders off on his patrol, then take the meats and leave before he comes back. You don't need to fight him.
  accept 312                                  -- Tundra MacGrann
  collect 2667 quest 312.1                    -- MacGrann's Dried Meats: the meat locker; below ground
