# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Ironforge: one round of the city

step Tinker Town
  zone Ironforge
  tip East from the Great Forge into Tinker Town: the Misplaced Packages lie by its mailbox. From here the guide goes once round the city: north to the Forlorn Cavern, west to the Mystic Ward, south through the Commons to the High Seat, east through the Military Ward and back to Tinker Town for the tram.
  accept 97263 optional                       -- Misplaced Packages, by the mailbox in Tinker Town

step The Forlorn Cavern
  zone Ironforge
  tip North of the Great Forge: Eldrun Stormbreaker, the shaman trainer, stands at the south end of the Forlorn Cavern, the rogue and warlock trainers and Lago Blackwrench just north of him.
  turnin 97263 optional                       -- Eldrun Stormbreaker
  accept 1715 only Warlock                    -- Lago Blackwrench: Gakin the Darkbinder in Stormwind takes it
  train class only Rogue,Shaman,Warlock

step The Tome of Divinity
  only Paladin
  zone Ironforge
  tip West from the Forlorn Cavern into the Mystic Ward: Brandur Ironhammer, Tiza Battleforge and Muiredon Battleforge are in the Hall of Mysteries, Tiza and Muiredon on its upper floor: the stairs up start just north-east of Brandur. John Turner, a beggar, wanders the city. He asks for ten Linen Cloth: the troggs and trolls of Dun Morogh drop it, and the Auction House sells it.
  level 12 only Paladin

step Narm Faulk
  only Paladin
  zone Dun Morogh
  tip Head back out of Ironforge and east along the road to Helm's Bed Lake. Narm Faulk lies dead by its shore: use the Symbol of Life on him. The Dark Iron Spies sneaking around the lake carry the script.
  level 12 only Paladin

