step The Deeprun Tram
  zone Ironforge
  tip East back into Tinker Town: the Deeprun Tram leaves from its east end. Ride it to Stormwind.
  goto 78.0,51.4 "Deeprun Tram"

step Tram to Stormwind
  zone Ironforge
  tip On the Ironforge platform of the Deeprun Tram, Monty asks for help with the rats: use his Rat Catcher's Flute on the Deeprun Rats around the platform, hand them in, then take his letter to his brother Nipsy at the Stormwind end.
  accept 6661 @78.0,51.4                      -- Monty, on the Ironforge platform
  kill 13016 x5 quest 6661.1 @78.0,51.4 "Catch Deeprun Rat" -- Deeprun Rat: use the Rat Catcher's Flute
  turnin 6661 @78.0,51.4                      -- Monty
  accept 6662 @78.0,51.4

step Nipsy
  zone Stormwind City
  tip Ride the tram to Stormwind: Nipsy waits on the Stormwind platform. Furen Longbeard stands in the Dwarven District, just outside the tram.
  turnin 6662 @64.5,7.5                       -- Nipsy, on the Stormwind platform
  turnin 1338                                 -- Furen Longbeard

step Baros Alexston
  zone Stormwind City
  tip From the Dwarven District south-west to Cathedral Square: Baros Alexston's compass is in his old house in Westfall, on the way. The flight master and the Trade District are south of the square.
