# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Class quests in Stormwind

step Defensive Stance
  only Warrior
  zone Stormwind City
  tip From Westfall, walk to Stormwind; the tram from Ironforge arrives in the Dwarven District. Ilsa Corbin trains warriors in Old Town; Harry Burlguard and Bartleby stand together by the Pig and Whistle Tavern there. Bartleby fights you for his mug. If Ilsa doesn't offer A Warrior's Training, go straight to Harry: he gives Bartleby the Drunk without it.
  accept 1638 npc 5480                        -- Ilsa Corbin
  turnin 1638                                 -- Harry Burlguard
  accept 1639
  turnin 1639                                 -- Bartleby
  accept 1640
  kill 6090 quest 1640.1                      -- Beat Bartleby
  turnin 1640
  accept 1665
  turnin 1665                                 -- Harry Burlguard: Defensive Stance

