step Surena Caledon
  only Warlock
  zone Elwynn Forest
  tip Leave Stormwind by the main gate, go south to Goldshire and east along the road to the Brackwell Pumpkin Patch. Surena Caledon (level 9) stands by its farmhouse.
  collect 6810 quest 1688.1                   -- Surena's Choker: Surena Caledon

step The Binding
  only Warlock
  zone Stormwind City
  tip Back to Gakin. Use the Bloodstone Choker at the summoning circle in the Slaughtered Lamb's cellar and defeat the voidwalker it calls. Goldshire and east Elwynn are next, then Westfall.
  turnin 1688                                 -- Gakin the Darkbinder
  accept 1689
  complete 1689                               -- Subdue the voidwalker
  turnin 1689                                 -- Summon Voidwalker

step Jennea Cannon
  only Mage
  zone Stormwind City
  tip Jennea Cannon stands in the Wizard's Sanctum, the tower of the Mage Quarter; she gives you a flask for the Mirror Lake waterfall.
  accept 1861                                 -- Jennea Cannon

step Mirror Lake
  only Mage
  zone Elwynn Forest
  tip Leave Stormwind by the main gate. The Mirror Lake waterfall is south-west of the gates, on the way west to Westfall: fill Jennea's Flask at its base.
  collect 7206 quest 1861.1                   -- Mirror Lake Water Sample

step Goldshire
  zone Elwynn Forest
  tip Leave Stormwind by the main gate and follow the road south to Goldshire: east Elwynn comes before Westfall.
  goto 42.1,65.9 "Goldshire"